{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <strong>Stack &amp; Sort Pals</strong>, a delightful and brain-teasing puzzle game where logic and strategy lead to victory! Your mission is simple yet challenging: <strong>sort and stack colorful blocks</strong>, each representing a cute animal, into perfectly organized columns. But beware\u2014every move counts!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>How to Play:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc3e <strong>Drag &amp; Drop</strong> \u2013 Move blocks around and stack them by color.<br>\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Plan Your Moves</strong> \u2013 Think ahead to avoid getting stuck and clear the board efficiently.<br>\ud83c\udf08 <strong>Solve the Puzzle</strong> \u2013 Organize every column so each one contains a single color.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714 <strong>Hundreds of Puzzles</strong> \u2013 From easy warm-ups to mind-bending challenges!<br>\u2714 <strong>Adorable Blocky Friends</strong> \u2013 Meet charming animals with unique personalities.<br>\u2714 <strong>Relaxing Yet Addictive</strong> \u2013 Simple to pick up but hard to master!<br>\u2714 <strong>No Time Limits</strong> \u2013 Enjoy stress-free puzzle-solving at your own pace.<br>\u2714 <strong>Colorful &amp; Engaging Design</strong> \u2013 A visually appealing world full of fun and charm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think you have what it takes to master the art of sorting? Test your skills and <strong>become the ultimate stacking champion</strong> in <strong>Stack &amp; Sort Pals</strong>! \ud83c\udfc6\ud83d\udc36\ud83d\udc31</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3578130?t=1743692321","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3578130?t=1743692321","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578130/2b3b394dca59d84eb9549a37d7f917d88db1a32b/capsule_231x8